  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "I would first like to have some criticism on the new open beta nameplates. \n\nThe First issue I have is that the pronouns and the status are truncated, which makes the profile in the QM less readable. Another issue I'd like to address is the icons being on the group instead of inside the user nameplate, which also makes is hard to recognize if the group is a.) Transparent, or b.) Has a similar color to the icons. The 3rd issue is Accessibility (for colorblindness), the yellow ring around the nameplates is super confusing to those with colorblindness and can make it seem like the user is speaking but in reality is not.\n\nThe nameplate I have listed Aims to tackle every issue that was wrong with the new nameplates, whilst still keeping the traditional \"VRChat\" style.",
